BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Snake Meet and Greet\, Brown County State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260709T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260709T113000
UID:1c606162eaf31f4279130e5690fd8553@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Come to the Nature Center for an up close and personal look at
  one of Indiana&#39\;s native snakes! Learn about their unique traits\, th
 e threats they face\, and how snakes affect your life! Participants may pe
 t the snake at the end of the program. Please be aware this program involv
 es a live animal.
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Abe Martin Lodge\, 1405 S.R. 46 W\, Nas
 hville\, IN 
URL:https://on.in.gov/browncountysp
X-SOURCE:Brown County State Park
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Strahl Lake Hike\, Brown County State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260710T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260710T094500
UID:549dcdc06c778da1058dd911e1d6cc7b@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Join a park naturalist for a guided hike of Trail 6 around Lak
 e Strahl! Hear about the history of the lake\, the surrounding Strahl Vall
 ey\, and learn about the animals that make it their home. The section of T
 rail 6 around Lake Strahl is considered easy to moderate. It has some shor
 t staircases\, uneven surfaces\, and wet spots. The trail is less than a m
 ile and will take about 45 minutes to complete.
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Lake Strahl parking lot\, 1405 S.R. 46 
 W\, Nashville\, IN 
URL:https://on.in.gov/browncountysp
X-SOURCE:Brown County State Park
END:VEVENT
