DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260712T120000
UID:c3d23cb885715764245050199b4938e6@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Visit the lobby of the Abe Martin Lodge anytime between 11am a
 nd noon to see two of Brown County State Park&#39\;s native turtles! Take 
 a quick look at the differences between aquatic and terrestrial (land) tur
 tles. Ask questions and take a chance to pet a turtle. If the weather is n
 ice\, we may be on the front porch instead.
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Abe Martin Lodge (lobby)\, 1405 S.R. 46
  W\, Nashville\, IN 
URL:https://on.in.gov/browncountysp
