BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Discovery Trail Hike\, Brown County State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260719T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260719T144500
UID:770cab48636f1d688ce086de15532dc1@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Join a park naturalist for a guided hike of the Discovery Trai
 l. This is a general hike about a variety of Brown County State Park topic
 s. Learn about flora\, fauna\, pioneer history\, and the interesting geolo
 gy of Brown County State Park. The Discovery Trail is about half a mile lo
 ng and considered moderate. There are muddy spots\, uneven surfaces\, and 
 slopes. The trail will take us about 40 minutes to complete.
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Discovery Trail (Nature Center parking 
 lot)\, 1405 S.R. 46 W\, Nashville\, IN 
URL:https://on.in.gov/browncountysp
X-SOURCE:Brown County State Park
