BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mothing in Indiana\, Brown County State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260725T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260725T230000
UID:491dd54e89d059f890500cc818459e1e@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Moths may conjure images of drab and brown insects fluttering 
 at our porch lights\, but with over 2\,300 species recorded in the state\,
  there&rsquo\;s much to learn about these mostly-nocturnal fliers. We&rsqu
 o\;ll have a few lights set up to attract moths to a white sheet so we can
  view the stunning diversity of these little gems. This is an excellent pr
 ogram for families\, and children of all ages are encouraged to attend. Br
 ing a flashlight for best viewing of moths on the sheet.
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Nature Center\, Friends' Shelter\, 1405
  S.R. 46 W\, Nashville\, IN 
URL:https://on.in.gov/BrownCountySP
X-SOURCE:Brown County State Park
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Turtle Time\, Brown County State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260726T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260726T113000
UID:55bb825e0f50085cf4ef61d219550249@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Come see an eastern box turtle as we feed it! Learn about the 
 unique adaptations these creatures have\, what issues they face\, and how 
 you can help their wild populations! If the weather is nice\, we will be o
 n the lawn outside the Nature Center. Otherwise\, we will be inside.
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Nature Center\, 1405 S.R. 46 W\, Nashvi
 lle\, IN 
URL:https://on.in.gov/BrownCountySP
X-SOURCE:Brown County State Park
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Vintage Video\, Brown County State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260727T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260727T113000
UID:7db34810e8d45294c9d5170820a33505@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Join a park naturalist and view a 1940s era advertisement for 
 Indiana State Parks! Learn about the mission of Indiana State Parks\, see 
 highlights of some of our famous locations\, and learn how as our understa
 nding of our resources changes\, so must our policies and practices! The p
 rogram and video lasts 30 minutes total.
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Nature Center\, 1405 S.R. 46 W\, Nashvi
 lle\, IN 
URL:https://on.in.gov/browncountysp
X-SOURCE:Brown County State Park
END:VEVENT
