DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260729T120000
UID:cedeb818ca2483886be432c56cd9d769@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Visit the lobby of the Abe Martin Lodge anytime between 11am a
 nd 12pm to see fossils\, geodes\, and other interesting rocks! Learn about
  the geologic processes found in Indiana&#39\;s bedrock and ask the natura
 list your questions! If the weather is nice\, we may be on the front porch
  instead.
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Abe Martin Lodge (lobby)\, 1405 S.R. 46
  W\, Nashville\, IN 
URL:https://on.in.gov/browncountysp
X-SOURCE:Brown County State Park
